      `the notification includes full details of the conformity assessment module or modules` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notification includes full details of the types of AI systems concerned` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the notification includes the relevant attestation of competence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
